{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/extras/DV_Spot_The_Twist.png?t=1741793403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deja View is a relaxing yet challenging spot-the-difference puzzle game, filled with surreal hand-drawn illustrations from Bleeding Moon Studio. Explore dream-like worlds as you uncover subtle differences hidden within beautiful artwork.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/extras/DV_Features.png?t=1741793403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">16 surrealistic hand-drawn illustrations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each illustration split into two intricate halves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover 15-20 unique differences per puzzle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Earn hints as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock achievements and captivating artwork descriptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Atmospheric soundtrack tailored to each artwork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy completed illustrations in full view mode.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in an artistic puzzle experience, combining observation, relaxation, and creativity.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3581940?t=1741793403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/dfbc05a5fc2a68ee12e9b0656802cf94f80e2bad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741793403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3581940/cb62281b6fd5a36ad42ea98f534dcd28db7f6860/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741793403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets